{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00869","headline":"鼓吹曲辞 巫山高 · 于濆","name":"鼓吹曲辞 巫山高","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"何山无朝云，彼云亦悠扬。\n何山无暮雨，彼雨亦苍茫。\n宋玉恃才者，凭云构高唐。\n自重文赋名，荒淫归楚襄。\n峨峨十二峰，永作妖鬼乡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"于濆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00869.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00869","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}